            "review_title": "Review at Leng Keng Zone",
            "review_text": "Challie T\n13 contributions\n0\nWaste of Time\nMar 2016 • Family\nWent here on recommendation with the family. We were served hot beer and sprite to start with. Given one menu while 4 staff stood over us waiting for our order. When we did get our food the meat was tough and we didn't even touch one of the dishes. Would stay away from this place!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 28, 2016",
