            "review_title": "Review at Leng Keng Zone",
            "review_text": "Charlie V\nCheltenham, United Kingdom185 contributions\n0\nAmazing food!\nOct 2015 • Family\nWe went here with an iTour moped tour. We were served with a range of meats, including ostrich, beef, octopus, etc. The moped riders sat with us, barbecued the meat on the grills on our table, and told us how and what to eat. The food was fabulous. my favourite was octopus in a chilli and lime marinade. Quite superb!\n\nNo idea how much it cost, nor whether they speak English. But go if you can!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 22, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
