            "review_text": "DuBaTa\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nFavorite Place\nJul 2015 • Friends\nThe restaurant is set up like a street with traffic lights, gardens, market and city partitions, All food tastes delicious, the fresh air makes it comfortable and the kitchen is amazingly fast in their production although this place is always packed at dinner time. My favorite place for after work BBQ and Tiger Beer Tower!\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 31, 2015",
